  "body": "Use the measured93s initialization and42s capture-pair cost to give one zero-model SDK3 seven-pose replay a600s child/630s container envelope. Preserve rendering settings and all existing source/verdict files, reuse the original progress bootstrap in private globals, and inspect CPU geometry immediately after the seventh original Road read before camera restoration.\n\nThe new receiver authenticates all source images, target bytes, observer identity/position, bounded triangle archive and independent CPU intersections. Source mismatch or partial scan remains inconclusive; CPU candidates never establish GPU pixel ownership, cause, repair or original model/Stage7 success. Original3/4PASS/overallFAIL remains. Focused96 CPU regressions and actionlint pass. Full exact-source CI and one fresh whole-branch review precede a single versioned hosted trial. No local SDK/model execution, publication or merge.\n",
